          "docs": "Example: `http://company.com/api/v3/stores/:store_id/appointments/:id_or_code`\n\nExample: `http://company.com/api/v3/stores/:store_number/appointments/:id_or_code?store_number=true`\n\nExample: `http://company.com/api/v3/stores/:store_id_or_number/appointments/:id`\n\nExample: `http://company.com/api/v3/stores/:store_id_or_number/appointments/:code`"
        },
        {
          "info": {
            "name": "Create an Appointment",
